     3492                     .
     3493   if valid-handle( g#lib-rvs ) <> yes then do:       run str/lib-rvs.p persistent no-error.       if error-status :error or valid-handle( g#lib-rvs ) <> yes then do:         message "Error starting lib-rvs.p" skip( 0 )           g#lib-rvs                        skip( 0 )           g#lib-rvs    :type               skip( 0 )           g#lib-rvs    :file-name          skip( 0 )           error-status :get-message( 1 )   skip( 0 )           return-value                     skip( 0 )         view-as alert-box error.         stop.       end.      end.     run lib-rvs_crrvslin in g#lib-rvs ( input buf_rvs-doc.obj-type ,
