     3542                       .
     3543   if valid-handle( g#lib-rvs ) <> yes then do:       run str/lib-rvs.p persistent no-error.       if error-status :error or valid-handle( g#lib-rvs ) <> yes then do:         message "Error starting lib-rvs.p" skip( 0 )           g#lib-rvs                        skip( 0 )           g#lib-rvs    :type               skip( 0 )           g#lib-rvs    :file-name          skip( 0 )           error-status :get-message( 1 )   skip( 0 )           return-value                     skip( 0 )         view-as alert-box error.         stop.       end.      end.     run lib-rvs_crrvslin in g#lib-rvs ( input buf_rvs-doc.obj-type ,
     3544                         input buf_rvs-doc.obj-code ,
     3545                         input buf_rvs-doc.rvs-code ,
     3546                         input buf_rvs-doc.rvs-type ,
     3547                         input buf_place.pl-code ,
     3548                         input buf_doc-pl.gds-code ,
     3549                         input ( if available prev_rvs-doc then prev_rvs-doc.rvs-code else ? ) ,
     3550                         input buf_rvs-doc.shift-date ,
     3551                         input buf_rvs-doc.shift-num )  .
     3552   if valid-handle( g#lib-rvs ) <> yes then do:       run str/lib-rvs.p persistent no-error.       if error-status :error or valid-handle( g#lib-rvs ) <> yes then do:         message "Error starting lib-rvs.p" skip( 0 )           g#lib-rvs                        skip( 0 )           g#lib-rvs    :type               skip( 0 )           g#lib-rvs    :file-name          skip( 0 )           error-status :get-message( 1 )   skip( 0 )           return-value                     skip( 0 )         view-as alert-box error.         stop.       end.      end.     run lib-rvs_crrvslnp in g#lib-rvs ( input  buf_rvs-doc.obj-type ,
     3553                         input  buf_rvs-doc.obj-code ,
