     8134     if input frame d-in-doc t-doc.exch-code <> t-doc.exch-code then do:
     8135       run choice-currency in this-procedure no-error.
     8136       if error-status :error then do: return no-apply. end.
     8137       run update-rate-doc in this-procedure no-error.
     8138     end.
     8139   end.
     8140   ON LEAVE OF t-doc.exch-date IN FRAME d-in-doc
     8141   or return of t-doc.exch-date  in frame d-in-doc
     8142   do:
     8143     if not available t-doc then return .
