     8145       assign
     8146         frame d-in-doc t-doc.exch-date
     8147       .
     8148     end.
     8149   end.
     8150   ON LEAVE OF t-doc.exch-rate IN FRAME d-in-doc
     8151   or return of t-doc.exch-rate in frame d-in-doc
     8152   or leave, return of t-doc.exch-scale in frame d-in-doc
     8153   or leave, return of t-doc.base-rate  in frame d-in-doc
     8154   or leave, return of t-doc.base-scale in frame d-in-doc
     8155   do:
     8156   if not available t-doc then return .
     8157     run update-rate-doc in this-procedure no-error.
     8158     if error-status :error then do:
     8159       run disp-exch in this-procedure.
     8160       return no-apply.
     8161     end.
     8162   end.
     8163   ON LEAVE OF t-doc.fact-date IN FRAME d-in-doc
     8164   DO:
     8165   if not available t-doc then return .
     8166     run chk-upd-date in this-procedure ( input self :name ).
     8167   END.
     8168   ON RETURN OF t-doc.fact-date IN FRAME d-in-doc
     8169   DO:
