    18894   PROCEDURE upd-cli-qnty :
    18895   define variable v-part-code  as character no-undo.
    18896   if available  ub.doc-line then do:
    18897     if dec( ub.doc-line.cli-qnty:screen-value in browse br-dtl) <>  ub.doc-line.cli-qnty then do:
    18898       if (dec( ub.doc-line.cli-qnty:screen-value in browse br-dtl) = 0.00 or
    18899           dec( ub.doc-line.cli-qnty:screen-value in browse br-dtl) = ?) and not t-doc.flag_ then do:
